<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Como Ta o Role?</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <main class="app-shell">
    <section class="hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">Termometro do role</p>
      <h1>Como Tá o Rolê?</h1>
      <p>Crie um rolê, mande o link para seus amigos e veja o clima em tempo real.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="card">
      <form action="/roles" method="POST" class="stack">
        <label for="nome">Nome do rolê</label>
        <input id="nome" name="nome" type="text" maxlength="100" required placeholder="Ex: Sexta na casa da Ana">
        <button type="submit" class="primary-button">Criar rolê</button>
      </form>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
